  "notable_quotes": [
    "Using an acid-base mixed-ligand strategy with rigid bis(triazole) ligand L and Zn2+ produced two new MOFs, {[Zn2(L)(TP)2(H2O)·H2O]}n (1) and [Zn(L)(HTMA)]n (2).",
